OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans pay tribute to teens
OL,4,Awho died in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans have paid tribute to
OL,7,Fthree teenagers who died after their
OL,8,Fcar entered a river.
OL,10,FJackson Duke, 17, Luke Etheridge and
OL,11,FZara Shaw, both 16, were in a black
OL,12,FAudi A3 that came off the road at Panns
OL,13,FBank near Wearmouth Bridge, Sunderland,
OL,14,Fand plunged into the water on 29
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FFootball fans at the Sunderland v
OL,18,FBrighton match held a minute's applause
OL,19,Ffor the teenagers before kick-off,
OL,20,Fwhilst photos of the trio were
OL,21,Fdisplayed at the Stadium of Light.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
